{
  "version": "1.8",
  "status": "online-regression",
  "description": "Deployed-system regression benchmark for the public Ask Youssef AI API. It validates orchestration, source use, exact structured facts, filtered inventories, multilingual follow-ups, current-role facts, capability claims, safety abstention, contact behavior, and basic scope control without pretending to semantically grade every generated sentence.",
